.TH SDL_GamepadHasAxis 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GamepadHasAxis \- Query whether a gamepad has a given axis.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gamepad.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_GamepadHasAxis(SDL_Gamepad *gamepad, SDL_GamepadAxis axis);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This merely reports whether the gamepad\(aqs mapping defined this axis, as that is all the information SDL has about the physical device\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I gamepad
a gamepad\[char46]
.TP
.I axis
an axis enum value (an
.BR SDL_GamepadAxis
value)\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true if the gamepad has this axis, false otherwise\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

